            <title>3.6.2</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 12:56:24 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>170</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.6.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- Creating a folder through a paired Mac now reports why it failed: a write-protected location reads "permission denied" instead of "cannot create folder", and a parent that is missing or is not a folder is refused up front. This also covers creating folders from Canopy Mobile.
]]></description>
